<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Emulation Buddy</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
    <script type="module" src="script.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Video Game Emulation Buddy</h1>
    <script src="https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client" async defer></script>
    <div class="login-container">
    <div class="google-logo"></div>
    <a href="/auth/google"><button class="btn">Login with Google</button></a>
    </div>
    <div id="user-info">
      <% if (user) { %>
        <p> Logged in as: <%= user.displayName %> </p>
        <a href="/auth/logout"><button class="btn">Logout</button></a>
      <% } else { %>
        <p> Not logged in </p>
      <% } %>
    </div>
    <hr />
    <search >
        <form action="/search" method="get" id="search-form">
            <label for="game-input">Search for a video game : </label>
            <input type="search" id="game-input" placeholder="Game Title">
            <button type="submit">Search</button>
        </form>
    </search>
    <div id="results">
    </div>
    <button id = "consoles-button" method="get" action= "/consoles">Display All Known Consoles</button>
    <div id="consoles-list">
    </div>
    <div id="edit-modal" class="modal">
      <div class="modal-content">
        <h3>Update Console Emulator Information</h3>
        <p id="modal-console-name"></p>
        <label>Emulator Name :</label>
        <input type="text" id="modal-emulator-name" />
        <label >Emulator URL :</label>
        <input type="text" id="modal-emulator-url" />
        <button id="modal-save-button">Save</button>
        <button id="modal-cancel-button">Cancel</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <hr>
    <p>
      An Independant project to build an encyclopedia of emulators that can be
      used in place of older video game consoles that may be non-functional,
      beyond repair, or no longer compatible with modern televisions. Specifically,
      this is meant to help people locate the emulators they need to enjoy specific
      video games for which they may not remember the name of the console on which 
      it was released<br />
      <hr />
      <strong>REMEMBER :</strong> video game piracy is "illegal", the existence
      of this document is not supporting the practice of downloading pirated
      roms, but hopes to preserve the experience of playing older games for the
      next generation. Support official releases where they are available.
    </p>

  </body>
</html>
